## Assembly

{% if p.removed_pin_positions is defined %}
Push out pins **{{ p.removed_pin_positions | join(', ') }}**. Retain pins **{{ p.retained_pin_positions | join(', ') }}** and keep the plastic strip intact.
{% if 'vertical' in p.taxonomy_5 %}

Count from the bottom. Use three identical vertical strips side by side, with the empty bottom and top cells captured by the base and its included top retainer. Mate one three-way socket housing to each active row.
{% else %}

Count from negative X, the key side for the basic, power and I²C types. Motor variants remove both end contacts symmetrically. Seat the strip across the plate, with one set of 6.25 mm ends facing forward and the equal rear ends inside the socket housing.
{% endif %}
